              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "منظر — manẓar — \"a view; scenery\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "كان المنظر من الجبل جميلا. kāna al-manẓar min al-jabal jamīlan. The view from the mountain was beautiful."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Plural: مناظر, manāẓir."
            }
          ]
        },
